WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.133
<v farida oyelaran>hi, thanks for calling, you're through to returns. i'm zoltan.

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:11.667
<v kenji petrov>hi, hello? is this -- sorry, can you hear me? this line's been terrible all day.

00:00:11.867 --> 00:00:14.133
<v farida oyelaran>i can hear you now.

00:00:14.333 --> 00:00:22.333
<v kenji petrov>okay, good. i'm calling about a return. i ordered a jacket from the strayth range and it's way too small.

00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:27.467
<v farida oyelaran>oh no. let's get that sorted. do you have the order number?

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:31.267
<v kenji petrov>yes, it's, um five eight oh three eight

00:00:31.467 --> 00:00:33.400
<v farida oyelaran>take your time

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:38.933
<v kenji petrov>zero four nine four five i think that's right, it's on the email.

00:00:39.133 --> 00:00:44.067
<v farida oyelaran>perfect, found it. delivered on 1/4/2025 to brennock falls?

00:00:44.267 --> 00:00:46.267
<v kenji petrov>that's the one.

00:00:46.467 --> 00:00:54.200
<v farida oyelaran>i also see an older order on the account, #3982710, but that's outside the window, so we'll leave it.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.600
<v kenji petrov>yeah, that's fine.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:01.933
<v farida oyelaran>so for strayth mobile items we can do an exchange or a refund.

00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:06.667
<v kenji petrov>refund, please. i'll just order a size up separately.

00:01:06.867 --> 00:01:13.400
<v farida oyelaran>sure. it'll go back to the card you paid with, which i have as 4012 8888 8888 1881.

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:20.333
<v kenji petrov>um, i actually cancelled that card. can you use this one instead? 4242 4242 4242 4242.

00:01:20.533 --> 00:01:28.000
<v farida oyelaran>refunds have to go to the original card, but your bank will forward it. or i can do store credit.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:31.333
<v kenji petrov>ugh. okay. store credit is fine.

00:01:31.533 --> 00:01:35.867
<v farida oyelaran>okay, $1,750 in store credit. you'll get an email.

00:01:36.067 --> 00:01:44.467
<v kenji petrov>oh -- and the straight jacket was marked down on your site the day after i bought it. can i get the difference?

00:01:44.667 --> 00:01:51.933
<v farida oyelaran>let me check... yes, we price-match within fourteen days. that's an extra six hundred dollars.

00:01:52.133 --> 00:01:54.467
<v kenji petrov>oh, nice, thank you.

00:01:54.667 --> 00:02:00.667
<v farida oyelaran>can i get a phone number in case the courier needs to reach you for pickup?

00:02:00.867 --> 00:02:05.533
<v kenji petrov>sure, six four seven, five five five oh one four eight.

00:02:05.733 --> 00:02:08.133
<v farida oyelaran>and is that a mobile?

00:02:08.333 --> 00:02:12.733
<v kenji petrov>yes. or my partner's, 555-0176, if i don't pick up.

00:02:12.933 --> 00:02:18.333
<v farida oyelaran>got it. pickup can happen any day this week. will someone be home?

00:02:18.533 --> 00:02:26.200
<v kenji petrov>yeah, i work from home. my daughter painted a big ladder on the parcel, so the driver can't miss it.

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:29.733
<v farida oyelaran>ha, love that. anything else today?

00:02:29.933 --> 00:02:34.200
<v kenji petrov>no, that's everything. thanks for being so quick.

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:37.733
<v farida oyelaran>my pleasure. have a lovely evening.
